3) XGobi Basics:

+ Click right mouse button: On-line help menu

+ Inside Variable Circle:
  Click left mouse button: Select variable on horizontal axis

  Click middle mouse button: Select variable on vertical axis

+ On Menu Item:
  Click and hold left mouse button

+ In Brushing Mode:
  Left mouse button moves brush

  Middle mouse button resizes brush

  Moving pointer to another location and clicking left mouse button
  causes brush to jump to this new location

+ Scatterplot Matrix:
  All variables are used that are currently active in the Grand Tour View

+ Persistent Brushing (in contrast to Transient Brushing) permanently
  keeps the brushing information

